{"id":"n8859246b50","headline":"Vehicle registrations dip in July as inventory buildup obscures true credit demand - Breaking News | Daily Mirror","summary":"Total motor vehicle registrations in Sri Lanka moderated to 53,221 units in July 2026, down from 58,151 units in June. The report attributes the trend partly to inventory buildup.","why":"Vehicle registrations are a gauge of consumer demand and credit conditions, and they affect automakers and import-dependent retailers.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Colombo","country":"Sri Lanka","lat":6.93,"lon":79.85,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"dailymirror.lk","url":"https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Vehicle-registrations-dip-in-July-as-inventory-buildup-obscures-true-credit-demand/108-349230"},"sources":[{"name":"dailymirror.lk","url":"https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Vehicle-registrations-dip-in-July-as-inventory-buildup-obscures-true-credit-demand/108-349230"}],"published_at":"2026-09-02T06:52:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"d3690e269df4e35f","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-02T06:52:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-03T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"}}